{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o128a","title":"全端全怿率众归降","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o128a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"全端全怿率众归降","evidence":["shaodi-e-o128a-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-2-e9","label":"正文","text":"司马昭使反间全怿等开门出降","evidence":["wgc-q0287","wgc-q0029"]},{"id":"wgc-a-5-e29","label":"正文","text":"全怿等开东城门出降城中乖离","evidence":["wgc-q0437","wgc-q0067"]},{"id":"hequan-a-86dbd41ffa8fe14186ae","label":"正文","text":"全怿救诸葛诞出城先降魏","evidence":["hequan-q-471873efe3c73342b238"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0042","role":"归降","evidence":["shaodi-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0118","role":"归降","evidence":["shaodi-e-o128a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"使反间以奇变说全怿等","evidence":["wgc-q0287","wgc-q0029"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0044","role":"被救于寿春者","evidence":["hequan-q-471873efe3c73342b238"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":257,"label":"冬十二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y257","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o117","basis":"冬十二月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o128a-q","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o128a-q","source_order":[4,534,"O128a"],"order":1194}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0042","name":"全端","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0044","name":"诸葛诞","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0118","name":"全怿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-471873efe3c73342b238","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7d40498a2406c90a8f04","layer":"original","quote":"救诸葛诞于寿春，出城先降。魏以为平东将军，封临湘侯","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o128a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b41ba43f7aca70555e83","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，吴大将全端、全怿等率众降〖38〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0029","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"吴将朱异再以大众来迎诞等，渡黎浆水〖1〗；泰等逆与战，每摧其锋。孙綝以异战不进〖2〗，怒而杀之。城中食转少，外救不至，众无所恃。将军蒋班、焦彝，皆诞爪牙计事者也；弃诞，逾城自归大将军〖3〗。﹝一﹞大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出。城中震惧，不知所为。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0067","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，征诸葛诞为司空。时，会丧宁在家〖1〗，策诞必不从命，驰白文王。文王以事已施行，不复追改。﹝一﹞及诞反，车驾住项；文王至寿春，会复从行。初，吴大将全琮，孙权之婚亲重臣也〖2〗；琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞。怿兄子辉、仪留建业，与其家内争讼；携其母，将部曲数十家渡江，自归文王。会建策，密为辉、仪作书，使辉、仪所亲信，赍入城告怿等，说“吴中怒怿等不能拔寿春，欲尽诛诸将家，故逃来归命”。怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离。寿春之破，会谋居多。亲待日隆，时人谓之子房〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":258,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0287","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0437","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":204,"end":232,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
